==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~30 seconds<sup>100f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~1 second<sup>2f~30f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cats]] for an easy victory.

